WEBVTT

00:02.002 --> 00:04.629
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:32.091 --> 01:32.926
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

01:33.009 --> 01:33.927
Oh no...

01:34.010 --> 01:34.928
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

01:36.679 --> 01:38.848
That girl bumped into a eunuch,

01:38.932 --> 01:41.100
which caused the ice to fall over.

01:41.184 --> 01:44.103
- Poor thing...
- Poor thing?

01:44.187 --> 01:46.356
I feel bad for the poor eunuch
who was carrying the ice.

01:46.981 --> 01:49.150
I hope he gets
nothing more than a whipping.

01:51.319 --> 01:54.114
I-I'm sorry...

01:54.197 --> 01:56.825
Please excuse her.
She neglected to pay attention.

01:56.908 --> 01:59.744
Do you think
an apology is going to fix this?!

01:59.828 --> 02:02.372
Don't think this is not a big deal!

02:02.455 --> 02:03.873
We don't have extra ice!

02:07.502 --> 02:09.796
Damn it! What am I going to do?

02:11.256 --> 02:13.383
<i>Ice is very valuable,
especially in this season.</i>

02:13.466 --> 02:15.426
<i>It's so valuable that
it can even buy a person.</i>

02:21.307 --> 02:23.476
Which consort was this ice for?

02:24.060 --> 02:25.520
Consort Loulan.

02:25.603 --> 02:27.730
She requested ice for her evening dessert!

02:29.566 --> 02:31.901
<i>Of all consorts...</i>

02:34.654 --> 02:37.323
<i>What do I do? I doubt she'll
accept money as compensation.</i>

02:37.407 --> 02:39.909
<i>To ruin the mood of a high-ranking consort
is also frightening.</i>

02:40.869 --> 02:43.580
<i>If only I could
prepare something in place of it...</i>

02:45.540 --> 02:47.292
Can I have this ice?

02:47.375 --> 02:48.793
Do as you like!

02:49.586 --> 02:51.212
All right. I will prepare something

02:51.296 --> 02:53.298
in place of this ice.

02:53.381 --> 02:54.924
Could you deliver that to Consort Loulan

02:55.008 --> 02:56.551
once it's prepared?

02:57.677 --> 02:59.387
Go ahead and try.

02:59.470 --> 03:01.222
But you have less than an hour.

03:02.181 --> 03:03.600
I understand.

03:03.683 --> 03:05.310
<i>Maybe I can make it.</i>

03:05.393 --> 03:08.104
<i>But will I be able to
gather all the ingredients I need?</i>

03:08.605 --> 03:11.274
<i>Anyway, I gotta do what I can do.</i>

03:15.904 --> 03:17.780
<i>Why is he here?</i>

03:19.574 --> 03:21.784
<i>This isn't the time to worry about that.</i>

03:33.338 --> 03:36.090
What should I do... Maomao?

03:39.260 --> 03:40.428
Poor thing...

03:44.557 --> 03:46.851
<i>She got so excited after receiving
a hairpin from a consort,</i>

03:46.935 --> 03:49.270
<i>and she wasn't paying
attention to where she was going.</i>

03:49.812 --> 03:51.189
<i>That consort...</i>

03:51.272 --> 03:54.150
Do you think she likes me?

03:54.234 --> 03:57.362
She asked me to give her
a massage again next time.

03:58.279 --> 03:59.405
I'm happy for you.

04:00.990 --> 04:04.369
<i>Since then, Xiaolan had been busy
looking for connections, and she was</i>

04:04.452 --> 04:07.664
<i>so happy when she started receiving
requests from lower-ranking concubines.</i>

04:08.873 --> 04:11.125
<i>Even though
she was sold off by her parents,</i>

04:11.209 --> 04:13.795
<i>she never once showed a sad face.</i>

04:15.129 --> 04:16.881
<i>She must've been so happy.</i>

04:20.093 --> 04:22.095
<i>Being yelled at and scolded like that</i>

04:22.178 --> 04:24.681
<i>made her too scared to even move.</i>

04:35.858 --> 04:37.151
Do you need something?

04:37.235 --> 04:40.154
Will you give me permission to use
the kitchen and some ingredients?

04:40.238 --> 04:42.865
That's a quite selfish request.

04:42.949 --> 04:44.158
What do I get for helping you?

04:45.535 --> 04:46.995
<i>That attitude...</i>

04:47.078 --> 04:48.997
<i>I don't have time for this!</i>

04:50.498 --> 04:53.751
I have nothing to give to you in return,
Lord Jinshi.

04:54.544 --> 04:55.670
But please give me permission.

04:56.963 --> 04:59.173
<i>I know I'm not in a position
to ask him such a thing,</i>

04:59.257 --> 05:00.675
<i>but I have no other choice.</i>

05:02.927 --> 05:05.179
What happened is not your fault though.

05:07.265 --> 05:08.433
Yes...

05:09.934 --> 05:11.102
<i>From the start,</i>

05:11.185 --> 05:14.355
<i>she was only my source for gossip.</i>

05:14.981 --> 05:16.065
<i>Moreover,</i>

05:16.149 --> 05:19.360
<i>I paid her back with snacks,
so I actually owe her nothing.</i>

05:22.780 --> 05:24.574
<i>I'm not obligated to help her.</i>

05:25.867 --> 05:26.868
<i>But...</i>

05:27.994 --> 05:30.246
If I don't do anything,
I won't be able to sleep at night.

05:37.420 --> 05:39.797
Yeah? You won't be able to sleep, huh?

05:39.881 --> 05:41.007
Yes.

05:41.090 --> 05:42.884
And it will impact my daytime duties.

05:43.468 --> 05:44.969
Well, I can't let that happen.

05:48.473 --> 05:50.349
Fine, but on one condition.

05:55.855 --> 05:59.192
When someone is talking,
listen to them until the end.

06:02.195 --> 06:03.946
Is that it?

06:05.698 --> 06:08.034
You say that, but you can't even do that.

06:10.244 --> 06:13.456
All right.
I guess I'll change the condition then.

06:13.998 --> 06:14.999
What shall it be?

06:16.459 --> 06:17.752
<i>I have a bad feeling about this!</i>

06:18.461 --> 06:20.505
<i>Maybe I should ask Lady Gyokuyou for help?</i>

06:20.588 --> 06:21.714
<i>No...</i>

06:21.798 --> 06:24.425
<i>I can't ask her to help me with something
that involves Lady Loulan.</i>

06:33.518 --> 06:35.311
Thank you...

06:35.394 --> 06:37.730
Do you not wear a hairpin?

06:38.272 --> 06:41.067
All the maids
in the Jade Palace wear them.

06:41.150 --> 06:44.320
Even if they do, it doesn't suit me...

06:44.946 --> 06:47.073
I gave one to you at the garden party.

06:48.366 --> 06:50.868
Don't tell me you sold it?!

06:50.952 --> 06:52.161
No, sir.

06:52.245 --> 06:53.204
<i>Not yet at least.</i>

06:56.666 --> 06:58.835
Go wear that then.

07:00.211 --> 07:01.587
Is that your condition?

07:02.296 --> 07:03.339
Are you not satisfied?

07:06.217 --> 07:07.260
After you wear it,

07:08.219 --> 07:09.762
I will tell you.

07:12.515 --> 07:14.642
I'll have the kitchen ready for you.

07:26.320 --> 07:27.155
I've brought them.

07:28.948 --> 07:31.492
- Please place them there.
- Got it!

07:33.202 --> 07:34.620
Maomao, these ingredients...

07:37.457 --> 07:39.959
Sugar, fruits, and...

07:40.042 --> 07:41.085
cow milk?

07:41.961 --> 07:44.088
I'm glad we had fresh milk.

07:44.172 --> 07:46.340
Since cow's milk spoils quickly.

07:47.091 --> 07:51.095
Can we really make
a frozen dessert with these?

07:51.179 --> 07:52.263
I think so.

07:52.930 --> 07:55.850
<i>I've seen it being made once before.</i>

07:55.933 --> 07:58.394
I'm counting on you.
This is our only chance!

07:58.478 --> 08:00.146
I will call you once it is ready.

08:09.030 --> 08:10.573
Mix this.

08:17.163 --> 08:18.080
What are you doing?!

08:18.748 --> 08:19.832
I'm smashing the ice.

08:21.000 --> 08:22.293
They're so small now!

08:22.376 --> 08:23.711
Don't worry.

08:29.842 --> 08:32.512
- This is good.
- Salt?

08:33.179 --> 08:35.473
Xiaolan,
put that bowl into the bowl of ice.

08:36.098 --> 08:37.058
Yes!

08:48.027 --> 08:49.487
What? No way!

08:51.697 --> 08:53.491
It's hardening!

08:53.574 --> 08:55.993
Xiaolan, cut the fruits into small pieces.

08:59.830 --> 09:02.625
<i>Now, put in the cut fruit, and mix.</i>

09:03.376 --> 09:05.461
<i>And put it into a serving dish.</i>

09:09.257 --> 09:10.675
Is it done?

09:10.758 --> 09:12.510
Is this...

09:12.593 --> 09:14.845
Yes, it's ice cream.

09:16.847 --> 09:18.891
<i>For now, this is good enough.</i>

09:18.975 --> 09:21.686
<i>If I had more time, I could've added eggs</i>

09:21.769 --> 09:23.688
<i>or added herbs for aroma.</i>

09:24.313 --> 09:25.773
Let's have him take it immediately.

09:25.856 --> 09:27.775
Yeah! But...

09:28.359 --> 09:30.778
maybe we should taste it first.

09:31.737 --> 09:34.031
<i>She's back to her normal self.</i>

09:37.118 --> 09:38.953
You can taste the leftovers.

09:42.331 --> 09:44.000
Delicious!

09:44.083 --> 09:45.293
What happened?

09:46.168 --> 09:47.587
Is it ready?

09:47.670 --> 09:48.921
Please take this to her.

09:51.048 --> 09:52.883
Is this really okay to serve--

09:55.970 --> 09:57.722
Is there a problem with it?

09:59.849 --> 10:01.976
Please hurry and take it to Lady Loulan.

10:02.059 --> 10:03.060
Okay!

10:06.063 --> 10:07.732
I'm so relieved...

10:08.316 --> 10:09.734
Thank you so much, Maomao.

10:10.318 --> 10:13.821
Well, we still don't know
if Lady Loulan will like it.

10:14.864 --> 10:16.616
You meanie!

10:17.366 --> 10:20.953
<i>I asked Lord Jinshi
what she likes beforehand,</i>

10:21.037 --> 10:22.580
<i>so I'm sure she will eat it.</i>

10:23.164 --> 10:24.165
Sheesh.

10:24.248 --> 10:26.959
Anyways, let's taste some more
before it all melts.

10:27.043 --> 10:28.961
Yeah, let's taste!

10:29.045 --> 10:31.839
- Oh, Shisui?
- What are you doing here?

10:31.922 --> 10:34.091
I heard about the commotion,

10:34.175 --> 10:36.886
so I ditched work and came here.

10:36.969 --> 10:38.346
You're so bad!

10:41.599 --> 10:44.060
This is delicious...

10:44.143 --> 10:48.105
Hey! Don't eat it all, okay?

10:51.108 --> 10:52.234
No...

10:54.779 --> 10:57.406
- It's mine!
- No!

10:57.490 --> 11:00.660
- Don't eat it all!
- It's all mine now!

11:01.702 --> 11:03.204
<i>This isn't enough.</i>

11:03.287 --> 11:05.289
- Give it!
- What the?!

11:05.373 --> 11:07.541
Hey...

11:08.125 --> 11:11.045
<i>Maybe I can make one more batch.</i>

11:11.128 --> 11:12.797
- Wait!
- Okay, open.

11:14.840 --> 11:17.343
Delicious!

11:18.636 --> 11:20.513
Now your turn, Shisui.

11:20.596 --> 11:22.306
Open wide.

11:32.358 --> 11:33.317
Oh my.

11:34.318 --> 11:35.653
It's kicking.

11:44.995 --> 11:47.123
Lingli. You want to touch?

12:02.888 --> 12:05.224
<i>The baby will soon be born.</i>

12:15.067 --> 12:17.069
<i>So far, the pregnancy is going well.</i>

12:18.279 --> 12:19.572
How strange.

12:19.655 --> 12:23.117
Unlike Lingli, this baby kicks downward.

12:24.285 --> 12:25.119
Downward?

12:25.703 --> 12:28.497
I guess they're showing their personality
even before they are born.

12:35.796 --> 12:38.924
May I touch your belly?

12:39.758 --> 12:41.594
Yes, go ahead.

12:42.344 --> 12:43.846
Excuse me.

12:55.691 --> 12:58.569
May I ask how Princess Lingli's
delivery went?

12:58.652 --> 13:02.072
The delivery was so smooth,
you wouldn't think it was the first time.

13:02.156 --> 13:06.076
She was quite small at birth,
so maybe that made it easier.

13:06.577 --> 13:07.953
Who delivered the baby?

13:08.037 --> 13:10.122
I did.

13:10.206 --> 13:12.416
It's because the physicians
here aren't so great,

13:12.500 --> 13:14.668
and the palace woman we hired
to help with the delivery

13:14.752 --> 13:17.213
suddenly fell ill.

13:17.296 --> 13:19.715
I was only able to assist because
I had studied about it beforehand.

13:20.341 --> 13:23.052
Will you be hiring
that same palace woman this time?

13:23.135 --> 13:24.261
No.

13:24.345 --> 13:27.306
If she falls ill again when the time
comes, it will be troublesome.

13:28.098 --> 13:31.727
<i>As a result, a different palace woman
assisted Lady Lihua's pregnancy.</i>

13:31.810 --> 13:35.314
<i>She was initially brought in
as a temporary midwife.</i>

13:36.023 --> 13:37.399
I see.

13:38.567 --> 13:42.029
<i>Do they plan to bring someone
from outside the rear palace this time?</i>

13:42.112 --> 13:44.031
<i>Hongniang may have assisted</i>

13:44.114 --> 13:46.617
<i>with the previous delivery,
however, it's not her specialty.</i>

13:48.702 --> 13:50.746
If there's something on your mind,
tell me.

13:54.708 --> 13:56.710
I can't say for sure, but...

13:57.253 --> 13:58.963
it might be a breech baby.

14:00.756 --> 14:02.132
A breech baby?

14:02.216 --> 14:03.133
Yes.

14:03.217 --> 14:06.554
The baby seems to be kicking downward.

14:07.137 --> 14:08.389
You said that when you were pregnant

14:08.472 --> 14:10.307
with the princess,
she was kicking upwards.

14:10.391 --> 14:12.059
That means her head was downwards.

14:12.893 --> 14:15.813
<i>When the largest part of the body,
the head, comes out first,</i>

14:15.896 --> 14:17.856
<i>it makes the delivery smooth.</i>

14:18.482 --> 14:21.443
<i>But if the feet come out first,</i>

14:21.527 --> 14:24.822
<i>it increases the risk of complications
during delivery.</i>

14:29.285 --> 14:31.078
Are you sure it's a breech baby?

14:32.121 --> 14:34.290
It's only a possibility.

14:34.373 --> 14:36.667
A physical exam might make

14:36.750 --> 14:38.210
it clearer.

14:39.003 --> 14:40.421
Can you do it?

14:42.715 --> 14:44.466
<i>I can't say for sure.</i>

14:44.550 --> 14:47.720
<i>My dad only taught me about medicine.</i>

14:48.554 --> 14:50.306
<i>Everything else
I've learned is just from observing.</i>

14:51.891 --> 14:52.808
Please do it.

14:59.148 --> 15:01.525
The method will be...

15:03.694 --> 15:05.237
Is that so?

15:07.781 --> 15:11.285
Compared to giving birth to Lingli,
that is nothing.

15:13.287 --> 15:15.497
<i>Moms are strong.</i>

15:19.710 --> 15:20.920
Understood.

15:34.433 --> 15:35.726
How was it?

15:35.809 --> 15:37.853
<i>It's hard to say but...</i>

15:39.355 --> 15:41.899
The likelihood of a breech birth is high.

15:43.067 --> 15:46.487
There's a chance that the baby
will flip itself in the womb,

15:46.570 --> 15:48.989
but it's late in her pregnancy.

15:51.408 --> 15:52.743
What should I do?

15:53.327 --> 15:54.620
I heard in the please district

15:54.703 --> 15:58.248
that moxibustion and exercise can help.

15:59.917 --> 16:01.502
I can help with the moxibustion.

16:01.585 --> 16:03.128
Thank you.

16:03.212 --> 16:05.005
I'll try to ask around for other methods

16:05.089 --> 16:07.174
outside of the rear palace.

16:11.387 --> 16:12.846
What will happen

16:12.930 --> 16:16.308
if the baby's position doesn't change?

16:17.810 --> 16:20.312
We will need to cut your body.

16:21.563 --> 16:24.817
- I see.
- Lady Gyokuyou.

16:24.900 --> 16:26.777
<i>But if that happens,</i>

16:26.860 --> 16:28.862
<i>that will put
Lady Gyokuyou's life at risk.</i>

16:29.363 --> 16:32.533
<i>Even if we have an experienced midwife,
it'd still be difficult.</i>

16:33.534 --> 16:36.453
<i>Only if that quack doctor
was a more experienced doctor.</i>

16:36.537 --> 16:38.831
<i>But where can we find a substitute doctor?</i>

16:41.917 --> 16:43.961
<i>Bringing a doctor into the rear palace</i>

16:44.044 --> 16:46.088
<i>means they need to become a eunuch.</i>

16:46.171 --> 16:49.174
<i>Is there a skilled doctor
who's also a eunuch?</i>

16:50.259 --> 16:53.095
<i>Yes. There's one person. He's perfect.</i>

16:53.971 --> 16:55.180
<i>But...</i>

16:56.348 --> 16:57.474
Maomao?

16:59.518 --> 17:01.854
I know of one individual.

17:02.896 --> 17:03.856
Really?

17:03.939 --> 17:06.567
His skills are top class,

17:06.650 --> 17:09.319
and he has delivered babies
by means of surgery.

17:10.195 --> 17:13.032
Who may he be?

17:14.074 --> 17:15.659
Don't tell me...

17:15.743 --> 17:17.494
Is it Lord Jinshi's attendant?

17:17.578 --> 17:19.496
Nope, it's a doctor.

17:21.915 --> 17:24.710
<i>Suiren, did you do something?</i>

17:25.461 --> 17:26.712
What is he like?

17:27.421 --> 17:31.133
He was banished from the rear palace.

17:32.051 --> 17:32.968
He's a criminal.

17:35.304 --> 17:36.889
I will not allow that!

17:36.972 --> 17:40.184
Lady Gyokuyou
and the baby's lives are at stake!

17:40.267 --> 17:41.977
It must be someone who we can trust!

17:42.061 --> 17:45.230
You can trust him.
He's the best doctor in the country.

17:48.358 --> 17:52.404
It's not like you to be so stubborn.

17:52.488 --> 17:53.572
But he's a criminal, right?

17:55.282 --> 17:56.784
I cannot trust such a person.

17:56.867 --> 17:59.286
- But!
- Hold on, you two.

17:59.369 --> 18:02.706
Hongniang, let her speak.

18:02.790 --> 18:05.292
And Maomao, please calm down.

18:10.130 --> 18:12.925
Tell me, what kind of sin did he commit?

18:13.008 --> 18:15.219
He is a eunuch...

18:15.302 --> 18:16.595
and he worked as a physician
in the rear palace.

18:18.097 --> 18:21.517
In the past, he delivered
the emperor, the current heir,

18:21.600 --> 18:25.145
and Lady Ah-Duo's child.

18:26.063 --> 18:28.899
The reason he was banished
from the rear palace

18:28.982 --> 18:31.443
is related to Lady Ah-Duo, so I've heard.

18:32.319 --> 18:35.656
<i>It's not like I heard it
directly from my father,</i>

18:35.739 --> 18:37.199
<i>or I know for sure.</i>

18:38.242 --> 18:39.326
<i>There are records,</i>

18:40.160 --> 18:41.787
<i>but it's just speculation.</i>

18:42.955 --> 18:46.333
How is he related to you, Maomao?

18:46.959 --> 18:50.587
He's my adoptive father.
He also taught me about medicine.

18:55.300 --> 18:56.468
I understand.

18:56.552 --> 18:59.721
Let me ask Lord Jinshi
if he can have him come.

18:59.805 --> 19:00.806
What?

19:00.889 --> 19:01.849
Lady Gyokuyou!

19:01.932 --> 19:03.308
Hongniang,

19:03.392 --> 19:05.936
I want someone capable to handle this.

19:06.728 --> 19:09.022
And if we can trust him,
then all the better.

19:09.940 --> 19:12.609
Also, I don't think he's a bad person.

19:13.110 --> 19:15.988
He can't be bad
if our stray cat is fond of him.

19:16.905 --> 19:17.739
<i>Stray cat?</i>

19:17.823 --> 19:19.992
- But he's a criminal!
- Hongniang!

19:21.034 --> 19:23.036
You know the stories about

19:23.120 --> 19:24.913
the rear palace back then, don't you?

19:25.747 --> 19:28.709
You know just how many
were manipulated during

19:28.792 --> 19:30.002
the era of the great empress.

19:31.086 --> 19:32.796
We can't blindly believe

19:32.880 --> 19:34.882
the accusations from that time.

19:38.719 --> 19:39.720
I understand.

19:40.470 --> 19:42.389
Now that we agree,

19:42.472 --> 19:45.225
I will need to start writing a letter.

19:45.809 --> 19:47.227
<i>Such strength...</i>

19:48.061 --> 19:51.481
<i>So this is what it means to be a consort
and a mother-to-be.</i>

19:54.359 --> 19:56.862
<i>Two days later
after speaking with Lady Gyokuyou...</i>

20:00.449 --> 20:01.700
Thank you very much.

20:02.826 --> 20:05.704
We've been waiting for you, Luomen.

20:18.550 --> 20:20.177
My, my...

20:20.260 --> 20:23.972
I never thought I'd be back here.

20:24.640 --> 20:27.226
<i>A man looking like an old woman</i>

20:27.309 --> 20:28.518
<i>entered the rear palace.</i>

20:32.105 --> 20:33.899
My name is Luomen.

20:34.650 --> 20:36.109
As a temporary doctor,

20:36.193 --> 20:40.030
I will be working at the medical office
of the rear palace.

20:40.113 --> 20:42.449
We've heard about you from Maomao.

20:42.532 --> 20:44.034
Thank you for helping us.

20:44.618 --> 20:45.786
My pleasure.

20:49.122 --> 20:51.083
<i>A temporary doctor, huh?</i>

20:51.166 --> 20:53.543
<i>Well, I guess that makes sense.</i>

20:54.294 --> 20:57.506
<i>I was worried that the quack doctor
will be discharged,</i>

20:57.589 --> 20:59.299
<i>but I'm glad
I don't have to worry about that.</i>

20:59.925 --> 21:02.094
Excuse me then.

21:04.680 --> 21:06.098
- Here you are.
- Yes.

21:11.895 --> 21:16.191
Hey, hey! That man
is your father, isn't he?

21:16.275 --> 21:18.110
Well, I guess...

21:18.193 --> 21:20.696
<i>To be correct,
he's actually my grand uncle.</i>

21:20.779 --> 21:24.449
He doesn't look anything
like I was expecting.

21:25.284 --> 21:28.370
He seems kind and gentle.

21:28.453 --> 21:30.831
Yeah, like a normal person.

21:30.914 --> 21:34.084
Did he really raise you, Maomao?

21:34.167 --> 21:35.877
I thought so too.

21:39.589 --> 21:42.050
- You girls!
- Um, well--

21:42.718 --> 21:44.511
What kind of guy were you imagining then?

21:45.095 --> 21:48.682
That's hard to say, but...

21:49.266 --> 21:50.934
He seemed like a decent man.

21:51.018 --> 21:52.477
Agree!

21:55.105 --> 21:56.231
<i>How rude.</i>

22:00.736 --> 22:03.947
GREAT TREASURE

23:46.049 --> 23:49.219
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:57.227 --> 23:59.896
<i>The next episode is "Festering Malice."</i>

23:59.980 --> 24:01.940
